1
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,080
Pretend you still love me until…

2
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,400
Until what?

3
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:35,040
Until I can accept it.

4
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,600
Welcome to King Boxing Camp.

5
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,080
Are you sure, Dech?

6
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:40,440
Save your voice for cheering at the fight.

7
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:42,000
Has Man gotten slower?

8
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:43,000
He's on drugs.

9
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:46,880
Either he goes down, or I do.

10
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,840
And that one chance is the day Dom fights?

11
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,360
If they die today,

12
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:52,360
this fight means nothing, right?

13
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:55,320
The boxer won't fight,
and the camp owner will be dead.

14
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,920
Can I go see my mom?

15
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:00,160
How can you go? Peng's already after you.

16
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:02,280
Six against one? That won't work.

17
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,920
Trust me.

18
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:41,960
- Oab.
- Get in the car before the cops come.

19
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:46,480
- We should go to a hospital nearby.
- No, Fon.

20
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,760
Why are you doing this to yourself?

21
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,280
If we go to the hospital,
it becomes a case.

22
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:52,000
But we were ambushed.
We didn't do anything wrong.

23
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,440
It has to be Peng's people.

24
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:59,200
If it's him, that's good.
He'll finally get arrested.

25
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:03,360
Arresting him won't be enough, Fon.
He might not even get caught.

26
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:07,680
- Get in the car. Let's go.
- Oab.

27
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,960
You're really going
to keep going like this?

28
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:17,960
Yes.

29
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:48,120
If I don't stop the bleeding,
you'll bleed out.

30
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,000
Thank you.

31
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,840
If you can't keep driving, tell me.
I'll drive.

32
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,320
Dom!

33
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:38,040
- Did you bring it?
- What?

34
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:40,320
- Where's the gun?
- Didn't bring it. Didn't wanna get caught.

35
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,600
What? And you're not afraid of dying?

36
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,240
Come here.

37
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,080
Hey, get in the car.

38
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,840
Get in the car. Wait here.

39
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,440
- Dech!
- Dech!

40
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,960
Dech!

41
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:20,320
Dech! Dom!

42
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,280
Dech!

43
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:31,880
Thank you.

44
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,960
They didn't charge us.

45
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:45,080
I'll go say goodbye to him.

46
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,360
Who was the person who died?

47
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:09,440
My sparring partner.

48
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,360
He just transferred from Ocean.

49
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:14,920
So this was Boss Peng's doing, wasn't it?

50
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:34,760
In this world, life means almost nothing.

51
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:42,000
People kill each other so easily.

52
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,200
But your life matters.

53
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:53,240
I don't know why you came here.

54
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:57,960
But you're fighting for other people.

55
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:04,400
Are you risking your life for them?

56
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,600
Think about it.

57
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:17,560
Today, when you asked to quit,

58
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,240
I'd let you go

59
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,120
if you promised

60
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:30,600
you'd leave to protect your own life.

61
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:36,080
Because your life

62
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,280
matters to me.

63
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,320
Plern.

64
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,680
Dom.

65
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,640
What happened to you? What's going on?

66
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:12,280
It was Dech.

67
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:14,640
Come with me.

68
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,320
Sit down first.

69
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:51,800
When you love someone,
you have to accept it, don't you?

70
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:11,760
Damn Peng.

71
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:23,920
- You sure you can still fight like this?
- I can, Oab.

72
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,720
I've handled worse.

73
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:30,400
I won't let your plan
fall apart that easily.

74
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:34,800
Everyone who died because of Peng
won't die for nothing.

75
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,440
You and I…

76
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:46,080
We're gonna see him die with our own eyes.

77
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:57,040
How long have you and Oab been together?

78
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,960
We've been friends since we were kids.

79
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:05,760
What about you?
How long have you been with Dom?

80
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:10,120
It's been a while.

81
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:16,480
We haven't been together long,
but I've seen him get hurt so many times.

82
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:21,560
You're amazing, Fon.
Oab must've been hurt countless times too.

83
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:25,960
Seeing him like this
already makes me want him to quit.

84
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,760
I'm scared he'll die.

85
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:36,560
If Dom agreed to quit,
I'd finally feel at ease.

86
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:43,520
Honestly,

87
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:46,400
if he quit, did nothing else,
and just stayed with me,

88
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:51,040
I'd take care of him
for the rest of his life.

89
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,880
You've only just met him.

90
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:00,360
Aren't you worried
Dom might already have someone?

91
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,120
No.

92
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,160
If he had someone,

93
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:09,800
she wouldn't let him
risk his life like this.

94
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:21,440
Come on.

95
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,560
Let's go home.

96
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:31,600
I came with Haw. I'm taking him back.

97
00:12:34,280 --> 00:12:37,560
Oab, could you take Haw back for me?
I'll have Dom take me home.

98
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,080
Sure.

99
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,520
Let's go.

100
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:59,360
- Why?
- What do you mean?

101
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,840
Why did you do that just now?

102
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:02,080
I didn't do anything.

103
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:04,040
You sure you didn't?

104
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:09,640
Didn't you say you wouldn't call me
until after the fight?

105
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,160
So why do I have to take you home?

106
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:14,600
If I was just staying home,
I wouldn't need you.

107
00:13:14,680 --> 00:13:18,000
But I came out to help you.
Shouldn't you at least take me home?

108
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:25,720
What if I go back alone
and someone attacks me on the way?

109
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:27,800
Okay. I get it.

110
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:29,680
I'll take you home.

111
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:33,880
Good. You should know you owe me.

112
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:40,000
Wait.

113
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:43,040
Why did you come alone?

114
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:46,280
Where are you going?
You don't even have a bodyguard with you.

115
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:50,480
You're my bodyguard.
Come on, let's go home.

116
00:13:50,560 --> 00:13:52,560
You're sneaking out alone, aren't you?

117
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:58,400
If I wasn't sneaking out,
I couldn't have helped you.

118
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,760
If you died,

119
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:07,280
I'd be devastated.

120
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:14,800
Why do you like her?

121
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,240
I'm way better than her.

122
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:27,920
That's ridiculous. Let's get in the car.

123
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,680
Are those two dating?

124
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:56,560
I'm not sure either.

125
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,760
But they do seem to like each other.

126
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:00,560
If they do, that's good.

127
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:03,640
Plern's father is a powerful lobbyist
and a very skilled politician.

128
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:06,000
If Dom ends up with her, whoa.

129
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,440
He would have it easy.

130
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,160
Fon.

131
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:58,200
I'll have Dom take me home.

132
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:21,360
I'LL WAIT OUTSIDE OAB'S HOUSE TONIGHT

133
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,880
You're here to explain yourself?

134
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,800
Yesterday, I went to see you.

135
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:31,360
I wanted to explain,
but I never got the chance.

136
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:34,440
I don't want you
to misunderstand about Plern.

137
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:38,520
Why did you never tell me
you had to take care of that woman?

138
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,920
Fon, it was work.

139
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:43,240
Work that meant
going out of town alone with her?

140
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:45,040
And now this.

141
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:47,640
How did she end up
thinking you two were together?

142
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:50,720
Oab told me to work for her.

143
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,080
He needs money from Plern to invest.

144
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:57,200
He wants to use that money
to start a new life.

145
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:03,920
Oab wants to quit,
leave everything behind,

146
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:06,440
and live with you.

147
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:10,079
Do you think I wanted to do this?

148
00:17:11,599 --> 00:17:12,800
I didn't.

149
00:17:13,599 --> 00:17:15,720
But he's my boss.
Whatever he tells me to do,

150
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,160
I have to do it as his subordinate.

151
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:28,400
Why do we have to fight
over something like this?

152
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:39,360
Because we love each other.

153
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:42,880
If I didn't love you this much,

154
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:45,400
I wouldn't try this hard.

155
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:49,000
I wouldn't even care who you were with.

156
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:53,400
I wouldn't have to worry
about how I act around Plern

157
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:54,760
just to make you feel better.

158
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:01,640
I trust you, Fon.

159
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:05,840
You have to trust me too.

160
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,040
Hey, Dom.

161
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,880
Hey. What are you guys doing?

162
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:43,920
It's Arm's death anniversary.
They're getting together tonight.

163
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,760
- Hey, Dom.
- Dum.

164
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:06,360
Hey, you still haven't taken the money
from last time.

165
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:09,120
Why are you giving me more?
Don't you need it to pay them?

166
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:13,320
Not yet.

167
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,320
Pear.

168
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:23,120
If I don't come back this time,

169
00:19:24,200 --> 00:19:25,720
take all the money I gave you

170
00:19:25,800 --> 00:19:28,960
and get as far away as you can, okay?

171
00:19:29,560 --> 00:19:30,680
You're saying this again.

172
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:32,400
Promise me.

173
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,280
You have to come back.

174
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:36,880
Just promise me first.

175
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:45,680
You weren't really building roads,
were you?

176
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:59,160
This job is dangerous.

177
00:20:01,080 --> 00:20:03,480
I don't know if I'll make it back alive.

178
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:11,440
Then please protect your life

179
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:16,480
and come back to me.

180
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:34,560
- Dum.
- Huh?

181
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:37,600
It's already been a year.
Is Oab still hurting over it?

182
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:39,000
Of course he is.

183
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:42,200
Even I can't get over it,
and I'm not even family.

184
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:46,560
And knowing the guy who did it
is out of prison,

185
00:20:47,200 --> 00:20:50,560
living comfortably,
it pisses me off even more.

186
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:52,400
The law can't do anything.

187
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:56,240
We're waiting to take matters
into our own hands.

188
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:21,760
Thank you.

189
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:26,120
- Fon.
- Yes?

190
00:21:26,760 --> 00:21:29,280
I'll pick you up this evening.
Come with me, okay?

191
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:31,360
Where are we going?

192
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:35,000
To see Arm.

193
00:21:43,640 --> 00:21:44,640
It's already been a year.

194
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:48,840
Time really flies.

195
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:12,960
<i>A year later,</i>
<i>Arm's killer still walks free.</i>

196
00:22:13,560 --> 00:22:15,800
<i>Still respected.</i>
<i>Still having people bow to him.</i>

197
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:18,160
<i>A year later,</i>

198
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:22,120
<i>I'm still grieving,</i>
<i>just like everyone who knew Arm.</i>

199
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,480
<i>Arm wasn't just my little brother.</i>

200
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,280
<i>He was my best friend,</i>

201
00:22:33,360 --> 00:22:34,560
<i>my family,</i>

202
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:37,120
<i>my everything.</i>

203
00:22:38,640 --> 00:22:40,320
<i>Tonight, I'll tell Arm</i>

204
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:44,200
<i>that the day</i>
<i>everyone's been waiting for is coming.</i>

205
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:49,600
<i>If you're up there watching over us,</i>
<i>I want you to know</i>

206
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:54,360
<i>we haven't forgotten you this past year.</i>

207
00:22:57,320 --> 00:22:59,320
<i>We were just waiting for the right time.</i>

208
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:28,040
Tomorrow, I'll get justice for you.

209
00:23:29,520 --> 00:23:30,600
Arm.

210
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,240
Fon.

211
00:23:52,320 --> 00:23:53,880
Wait for me at home tomorrow.

212
00:23:55,440 --> 00:23:57,600
It's too dangerous
for you to come to the arena.

213
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:00,680
Okay.

214
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:10,800
Once everything is settled,

215
00:24:13,080 --> 00:24:14,400
I'll come back home to you.

216
00:24:46,840 --> 00:24:47,880
This way, Boss.

217
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:51,120
Hello, Boss.

218
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:53,640
Long time no see, man.

219
00:25:03,800 --> 00:25:05,280
He's with me.

220
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:07,880
Come on in.

221
00:25:13,560 --> 00:25:14,480
Peng and his men are here.

222
00:25:15,520 --> 00:25:17,800
I see them.
Follow them and keep an eye on them.

223
00:25:17,880 --> 00:25:18,920
Yes, Sir.

224
00:25:29,120 --> 00:25:30,400
You ready?

225
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:33,120
Yes, Sir.

226
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:35,160
You better win that belt for me.

227
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:36,400
Yes, Boss.

228
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:55,080
‪How is it?

229
00:25:56,160 --> 00:25:57,480
I've got my men watching Peng.

230
00:25:58,240 --> 00:25:59,360
Thanks.

231
00:26:01,160 --> 00:26:04,280
I'm sorry I had to put your job
at risk like this.

232
00:26:06,080 --> 00:26:07,040
What are you talking about?

233
00:26:08,280 --> 00:26:09,720
I'm just doing my job.

234
00:26:10,320 --> 00:26:13,440
A fight could break out.
We had to be here.

235
00:26:19,040 --> 00:26:19,960
Thanks, man.

236
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:26,200
This is all I can do for you.

237
00:26:26,280 --> 00:26:28,160
From here on, you're on your own.

238
00:26:28,760 --> 00:26:30,000
Take care of yourself.

239
00:26:30,080 --> 00:26:32,880
You better come back
and celebrate Dom's win with me.

240
00:26:37,920 --> 00:26:42,080
Today's WBC middleweight
championship fight.

241
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:45,520
Red corner, Man Ocean.

242
00:27:08,480 --> 00:27:11,000
Tomorrow, drug him like I told you

243
00:27:11,080 --> 00:27:12,120
Yes, Boss.

244
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,520
I'll make him lose his strength.

245
00:27:14,600 --> 00:27:16,680
No matter how good he is,
he won't survive.

246
00:27:18,640 --> 00:27:20,280
Man, here's your food.

247
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:34,840
And the blue corner, rising star

248
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:36,960
Dom King.

249
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,200
Miss.

250
00:27:58,920 --> 00:28:01,280
- Oh, it's ready.
- Are the desserts ready yet?

251
00:28:09,080 --> 00:28:10,800
- Everything under control?
- Yes, Sir.

252
00:28:15,880 --> 00:28:17,040
Go for it!

253
00:28:17,120 --> 00:28:18,240
Come on!

254
00:28:23,520 --> 00:28:25,040
That's it!

255
00:28:25,120 --> 00:28:27,000
Get him! Take him down!

256
00:28:27,600 --> 00:28:28,800
Come on!

257
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:41,960
Get in there!

258
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:45,960
- Want some water?
- Yeah.

259
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:50,520
What's wrong with you? Got stage fright?

260
00:28:50,600 --> 00:28:52,080
Why isn't he fighting like himself?

261
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:59,400
- Come on!
- Let's go.

262
00:28:59,480 --> 00:29:00,760
- You got this!
- Go.

263
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:05,000
Go for it!

264
00:29:06,800 --> 00:29:08,320
Take him down!

265
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:10,080
Get him!

266
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:12,840
Fighting like this,
he's gonna get knocked out for sure.

267
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:19,760
He's out of his league.
How did this kid get a title shot?

268
00:29:19,840 --> 00:29:20,840
Exactly.

269
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:21,920
Whoa.

270
00:29:27,360 --> 00:29:29,040
You okay? Hey!

271
00:29:30,800 --> 00:29:33,240
- Are you still good? You alright?
- Yeah.

272
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:39,480
Didn't Oab say you weren't coming?

273
00:29:41,120 --> 00:29:42,600
I was worried.

274
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:45,320
Oab already made his decision.

275
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:50,520
Yes. So he'll wait until the fight's over?

276
00:29:54,640 --> 00:29:55,760
We're in the third round.

277
00:29:56,360 --> 00:29:57,760
Let's see if he goes down.

278
00:29:57,840 --> 00:30:00,520
- Fight!
- Easy. Don't rush.

279
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:22,840
Two, three.

280
00:30:23,600 --> 00:30:26,360
Four, five.

281
00:30:39,400 --> 00:30:41,720
Hey, what's up with the boss?

282
00:30:42,360 --> 00:30:43,280
What about him?

283
00:30:43,360 --> 00:30:45,600
I heard he bet on Dom's side.

284
00:30:47,280 --> 00:30:48,280
A lot too.

285
00:30:49,600 --> 00:30:51,720
Man, here's your food.

286
00:31:02,720 --> 00:31:06,120
You waste a lot of food.

287
00:31:09,800 --> 00:31:11,880
Yes!

288
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:15,880
Six, seven, eight.

289
00:31:15,960 --> 00:31:17,440
Dom!

290
00:31:17,520 --> 00:31:18,960
- Dom!
- Dom!

291
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:28,920
- You good?
- Yeah.

292
00:31:29,000 --> 00:31:32,080
You know how to box! Come on!

293
00:31:47,040 --> 00:31:50,160
You're strange.
All of a sudden, you want to watch boxing.

294
00:31:51,440 --> 00:31:52,920
I wanted to come cheer for Dom.

295
00:32:12,080 --> 00:32:15,560
- Come on!
- You can do it, Dom! Go for it!

296
00:32:15,640 --> 00:32:17,520
Go get him!

297
00:32:33,520 --> 00:32:35,720
Wow. I don't know what's gotten into Dom,

298
00:32:35,800 --> 00:32:37,840
but every punch is landing!

299
00:32:37,920 --> 00:32:39,800
- Get him!
- Good!

300
00:32:39,880 --> 00:32:41,440
Yeah, that's it!

301
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:54,160
Are you okay?

302
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:57,040
Hey, someone came
and told us to leave our post.

303
00:32:57,880 --> 00:32:58,920
Who?

304
00:33:03,360 --> 00:33:04,600
I'm taking over.

305
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:10,080
Hey.

306
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:15,240
Are you okay?

307
00:33:15,320 --> 00:33:18,680
NO ENTRY

308
00:33:18,760 --> 00:33:20,160
What are you guys planning?

309
00:33:20,240 --> 00:33:21,960
I'm following orders.

310
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:24,720
Whose orders?

311
00:33:28,080 --> 00:33:29,640
I'm just doing my duty.

312
00:33:31,480 --> 00:33:33,440
I don't have to report to you
why I'm here,

313
00:33:34,120 --> 00:33:35,320
what I'm doing,

314
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:38,360
or whose orders I'm following.

315
00:33:38,440 --> 00:33:39,360
Champ!

316
00:33:45,280 --> 00:33:46,600
What are you trying to do?

317
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:49,160
Let's just say,
if you don't leave your post,

318
00:33:50,040 --> 00:33:52,080
I'll have my men escort you out.

319
00:33:53,680 --> 00:33:54,840
- Damn, Champ.
- Hey.

320
00:34:06,080 --> 00:34:07,640
Save that respect for your own father.

321
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:20,880
Excuse me.

322
00:34:24,080 --> 00:34:25,120
Oab!

323
00:34:36,280 --> 00:34:37,120
Oab!

324
00:34:37,199 --> 00:34:38,440
Go! You got this!

325
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:44,240
- Move!
- Let's go!

326
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:47,520
Liang.

327
00:35:47,600 --> 00:35:48,800
Go!

328
00:35:50,600 --> 00:35:52,720
Boss, go! Hurry!

329
00:36:00,560 --> 00:36:01,600
Dom!

330
00:36:03,080 --> 00:36:04,600
Miss, hurry!

331
00:36:05,200 --> 00:36:07,160
Watch out! Move!

332
00:36:22,360 --> 00:36:24,000
Boss, get out! Hurry!

333
00:36:39,960 --> 00:36:40,920
Move!

334
00:36:43,040 --> 00:36:44,800
Get outside and wait. Let's go.

335
00:36:45,840 --> 00:36:47,840
- Be careful.
- Yes.

336
00:36:51,520 --> 00:36:53,280
Haw! Help me, quick!

337
00:37:02,640 --> 00:37:04,040
Fon, wait here for me.

338
00:37:04,120 --> 00:37:05,400
What? Dom?

339
00:37:06,720 --> 00:37:07,880
Fon, where's Oab?

340
00:37:14,400 --> 00:37:16,000
- What happened, Champ?
- Step back.

341
00:37:16,080 --> 00:37:17,160
Champ.

342
00:37:18,400 --> 00:37:21,520
Champ, you're responsible for this.

343
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:25,960
You can't do anything to me.

344
00:37:27,000 --> 00:37:29,440
I was just doing my duty.
I didn't do anything wrong.

345
00:37:30,440 --> 00:37:31,560
You're coming with me.

346
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:36,880
Dom.

347
00:37:39,080 --> 00:37:40,520
Let's go, Oab.

348
00:37:41,280 --> 00:37:42,640
Hey, you're amazing.

349
00:37:45,440 --> 00:37:47,280
- Not bad.
- It's not over yet.

350
00:38:39,080 --> 00:38:41,160
- Dum!
- Dum!

351
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:43,280
Dum!

352
00:39:06,640 --> 00:39:07,840
You're gonna pay for this.

353
00:39:09,120 --> 00:39:10,360
You're gonna pay for this!

354
00:39:12,560 --> 00:39:14,040
We have to go.

355
00:39:16,280 --> 00:39:17,720
Dom!

356
00:39:24,280 --> 00:39:25,920
If I don't take down Peng today,

357
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:28,760
you can step on my face.

358
00:39:37,160 --> 00:39:39,160
This place is dangerous.
Why are you still here?

359
00:39:44,200 --> 00:39:45,840
You can go back first, Dad.

360
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:47,040
What?

361
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:51,280
Go keep an eye on her.

362
00:39:54,160 --> 00:39:55,200
Hey.

363
00:39:56,040 --> 00:39:57,080
Where's Dom?

364
00:39:58,320 --> 00:40:01,600
- I don't see him.
- You didn't see him? I saw him with you.

365
00:40:02,200 --> 00:40:03,440
Do you see him now?

366
00:40:03,520 --> 00:40:05,080
If you don't, then neither do I.

367
00:40:06,280 --> 00:40:07,560
You know, but you won't tell me, right?

368
00:40:11,240 --> 00:40:13,960
Take me to your chief.
The one who sent you to the arena.

369
00:40:14,040 --> 00:40:16,120
You really don't know right from wrong.

370
00:40:16,200 --> 00:40:17,320
Hey.

371
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:19,280
You're the one
who doesn't know right from wrong.

372
00:40:20,240 --> 00:40:23,760
You interfered with my work
and used your position as an excuse.

373
00:40:24,520 --> 00:40:26,120
Take me to your chief.

374
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:27,960
I'll ask why he sent you here.

375
00:40:28,040 --> 00:40:29,320
To arrest Oab.

376
00:40:30,240 --> 00:40:31,920
I got word he was going after Peng.

377
00:40:32,000 --> 00:40:34,320
I was already here. Why send you?

378
00:40:35,200 --> 00:40:36,800
Maybe he didn't think you could handle it.

379
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:39,200
What did you say?

380
00:40:40,640 --> 00:40:42,320
There are two powerful figures involved.

381
00:40:43,080 --> 00:40:45,720
One unit like yours
might not be enough to handle them.

382
00:40:45,800 --> 00:40:47,800
You were the one
who ordered me and my men out.

383
00:40:47,880 --> 00:40:49,080
And what happened?

384
00:40:51,040 --> 00:40:52,520
You didn't catch anyone.

385
00:40:54,080 --> 00:40:57,720
Get warrants for Peng and his people
for causing a public disturbance.

386
00:40:57,800 --> 00:40:59,520
Don't be so sure yet.

387
00:41:01,320 --> 00:41:02,920
Oab's side could've started it.

388
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:04,600
I'm sure it wasn't Oab's side.

389
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:08,120
Fon's inside. Bring her in.
She's your person, right?

390
00:41:08,200 --> 00:41:09,560
I will.

391
00:41:11,200 --> 00:41:12,840
But today, they all got away

392
00:41:12,920 --> 00:41:15,600
because you interfered
with the officers doing their job.

393
00:41:15,680 --> 00:41:17,120
You'll be held responsible.

394
00:41:20,280 --> 00:41:22,040
If you think you're right, go ahead.

395
00:41:24,200 --> 00:41:25,760
Prepare for a disciplinary review.

396
00:41:40,720 --> 00:41:41,880
Why are you stopping?

397
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:45,280
I arranged to switch cars for you.

398
00:41:45,360 --> 00:41:46,360
Why switch?

399
00:41:46,960 --> 00:41:48,280
They might trace this car.

400
00:41:50,840 --> 00:41:53,800
Then go park at the station, not here.

401
00:41:58,120 --> 00:41:59,240
I can't, Boss.

402
00:42:06,320 --> 00:42:09,440
Why not? I said do it, so do it.

403
00:42:11,200 --> 00:42:12,760
Are you betraying me, Liang?

404
00:42:40,560 --> 00:42:42,640
You should've never messed with me.

405
00:42:44,080 --> 00:42:46,080
If you'd let me go that day,

406
00:42:46,160 --> 00:42:47,640
things wouldn't have ended like this.

407
00:42:54,720 --> 00:42:56,080
You killed my people.

408
00:43:12,640 --> 00:43:14,040
You killed my little brother.

409
00:43:36,600 --> 00:43:38,160
I'll kill all of you today.

410
00:43:38,760 --> 00:43:40,360
You'll die for nothing.

411
00:43:45,200 --> 00:43:46,320
Hey, go finish them off.

412
00:43:51,360 --> 00:43:53,200
Oab! I'll go help him.

413
00:44:01,480 --> 00:44:02,520
Damn it.

414
00:44:21,760 --> 00:44:22,640
Liang!

415
00:44:39,400 --> 00:44:42,080
Ten kilometers from the station.
Take him out before we arrive.

416
00:46:10,000 --> 00:46:11,600
Damn it.

417
00:46:51,920 --> 00:46:52,920
Damn.

418
00:48:20,360 --> 00:48:21,480
Dom.

419
00:48:42,080 --> 00:48:42,960
You're okay, right?

420
00:48:44,040 --> 00:48:45,160
I'm okay.

421
00:48:46,480 --> 00:48:49,240
I told you to wait at home.
Why did you come out here?

422
00:48:50,040 --> 00:48:53,440
Even if I waited at home,
my heart would still be here.

423
00:48:55,280 --> 00:48:57,440
So I had to come.

424
00:48:57,520 --> 00:48:58,880
I'm safe now.

425
00:48:59,960 --> 00:49:02,880
Go back home and wait.
I'll have someone take you.

426
00:49:04,960 --> 00:49:06,320
Where are you going?

427
00:49:06,400 --> 00:49:09,920
Dom, take Fon home. Then come back to me.

428
00:49:10,840 --> 00:49:12,120
Yes.

429
00:49:28,480 --> 00:49:31,560
You got your revenge.
You can quit now, right?

430
00:49:33,200 --> 00:49:35,600
Lock up the house properly
and don't open the door

431
00:49:36,600 --> 00:49:38,120
until Oab gets back.

432
00:49:40,080 --> 00:49:41,480
You're not going to answer me?

433
00:49:48,720 --> 00:49:49,880
Dom.

434
00:49:52,320 --> 00:49:53,640
Can you quit?

435
00:49:59,400 --> 00:50:02,720
I don't want you to think
this is just an excuse I'm using to stay.

436
00:50:05,920 --> 00:50:09,040
Just hear me out. Don't laugh at me
or think that I can't leave.

437
00:50:11,000 --> 00:50:12,280
What else are you going to say?

438
00:50:13,040 --> 00:50:15,200
You couldn't even keep
your promise to quit.

439
00:50:15,840 --> 00:50:19,120
When the time came, you didn't.
What do you actually want?

440
00:50:21,080 --> 00:50:25,520
But if I quit now, have you thought
about what happens if he finds out?

441
00:50:28,640 --> 00:50:32,640
If he finds out we betrayed him,
do you think he'll let us go?

442
00:50:37,600 --> 00:50:38,680
No.

443
00:50:41,160 --> 00:50:44,000
We'll both be hunted as traitors.

444
00:50:44,800 --> 00:50:48,360
That's why I can't leave this place.

445
00:50:50,440 --> 00:50:52,280
Until he's caught.

446
00:50:58,000 --> 00:51:01,000
He's a good person. It's not fair.

447
00:51:05,400 --> 00:51:06,640
Not fair?

448
00:51:09,440 --> 00:51:10,680
Yeah.

449
00:51:11,920 --> 00:51:13,440
Life isn't fair, Fon.

450
00:51:14,560 --> 00:51:18,280
Having to see you with Oab
and pretend I don't feel anything,

451
00:51:18,360 --> 00:51:20,120
that isn't fair either.

452
00:51:35,840 --> 00:51:37,280
I trust you, Fon.

453
00:51:40,120 --> 00:51:41,720
But I still feel it.

454
00:51:50,160 --> 00:51:53,320
I feel it too when you're with Plern.

455
00:52:05,840 --> 00:52:09,440
I want her to know that you belong to me.

456
00:52:26,000 --> 00:52:27,480
You're mine.

457
00:53:22,520 --> 00:53:23,560
Oab!

458
00:53:24,200 --> 00:53:26,440
Oab! Where is everyone else?

459
00:53:27,240 --> 00:53:30,080
What about Dum? Is he with Dom?

460
00:53:37,400 --> 00:53:39,440
Hey, Oab!

461
00:53:42,960 --> 00:53:45,280
Pong, where is everyone else?

462
00:53:50,240 --> 00:53:51,280
Pong.

463
00:54:00,520 --> 00:54:03,320
Hey. Dum didn't make it, did he?

464
00:54:39,960 --> 00:54:41,040
Dum.

465
00:54:48,320 --> 00:54:50,000
Once the news gets out,

466
00:54:51,160 --> 00:54:54,040
people in the territory
will start resisting.

467
00:54:54,120 --> 00:54:56,640
They'll want to break away,
stop answering to anyone,

468
00:54:56,720 --> 00:54:57,920
and stop paying their dues.

469
00:55:01,320 --> 00:55:02,560
The money they pay

470
00:55:04,120 --> 00:55:05,960
gets passed up the chain.

471
00:55:06,040 --> 00:55:09,800
You know that.
If they want to keep things easy,

472
00:55:09,880 --> 00:55:11,120
they have to pay.

473
00:55:12,080 --> 00:55:13,720
You need to make them understand

474
00:55:13,800 --> 00:55:16,880
who they'll be paying from now on.

475
00:55:17,560 --> 00:55:20,520
I gave you Peng's territory.
Can't you handle it?

476
00:55:20,600 --> 00:55:22,280
I want to.

477
00:55:23,880 --> 00:55:25,600
But my influence isn't like yours.

478
00:55:29,800 --> 00:55:33,160
Tonight is like the final test.

479
00:55:33,240 --> 00:55:34,680
If we can make them fall in line,

480
00:55:35,840 --> 00:55:37,680
they'll answer to us forever.

481
00:55:38,440 --> 00:55:39,440
But if we can't,

482
00:55:40,920 --> 00:55:44,520
these people
will become thorns in our side.

483
00:56:00,560 --> 00:56:01,520
I'm going.

484
00:56:10,800 --> 00:56:12,120
Take care of yourself.

485
00:56:40,800 --> 00:56:42,520
I dropped Fon off and locked up the house.

486
00:56:43,360 --> 00:56:44,400
Thanks.

487
00:56:50,480 --> 00:56:51,400
Hello?

488
00:56:52,400 --> 00:56:53,440
We're heading over now.

489
00:56:56,360 --> 00:56:59,560
Without Boss Peng,
I don't answer to anyone.

490
00:56:59,640 --> 00:57:02,400
My people and I can handle every shop

491
00:57:02,480 --> 00:57:05,320
in this territory ourselves. You two,

492
00:57:05,400 --> 00:57:07,520
get lost and tell your boss. Go!

493
00:57:07,600 --> 00:57:09,120
Wanna tell me yourself?

494
00:57:34,240 --> 00:57:37,600
This is the fifth shop already.
What has gotten into them?

495
00:57:47,360 --> 00:57:49,320
Being with Liang is better
than being with me, huh?

496
00:57:50,880 --> 00:57:52,440
You two are a perfect match.

497
00:57:53,880 --> 00:57:55,000
Traitors, both of you.

498
00:57:56,600 --> 00:57:58,040
- What are you trying to say?
- Hey.

499
00:57:58,120 --> 00:58:00,880
Enough. Stop it.

500
00:58:00,960 --> 00:58:03,320
POLICE SUSPENSION ORDER

501
00:58:03,400 --> 00:58:05,680
FOR SERIOUS MISCONDUCT WITHOUT JUST CAUSE,
THE OFFICER IS SUSPENDED FROM DUTY

502
00:58:06,800 --> 00:58:09,040
Am I in your way?
Is that why you're pushing me out?

503
00:58:09,960 --> 00:58:12,280
If Oab sees these,

504
00:58:12,360 --> 00:58:15,840
you and Dom won't just be running from me.
You'll be running from him too.

505
00:58:17,720 --> 00:58:20,560
I'll keep your precious things safe.

506
00:58:21,160 --> 00:58:23,040
If anything happens, I'm counting on you.

507
00:58:49,960 --> 00:58:52,640
Subtitle translation by:
Chomchanach Yanaharn
